{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "0028f21b7704615630f7af693cb67d255262248312a33fe2b13c3fc441bad724", "ja": "いきなり対決？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "66d34558b9fd74b802631f479c5b35d06bf9dc9c3851c2928c701303356ba502", "ja": "『ネトスワ』の支社を訪れたプロデューサー\nと未来、可奈、紬。先方の統括マネージャー\nから、ネトスワお抱えのアイドルグループと\nの対決企画を提示される。煽られた紬の苛立\nちを利用され、オファーを受ける流れに。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99e2720c6ad9154ce476846df17d78d9023cd14c39be903390511eac0d350cad", "ja": "（ネトスワ日本支社にやってきた！\nさすが大企業だけあって、エントランスも豪華だ……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cdcec2df6ea082d03d24486139f0e2027d5e0b8f955af7172ba4c22d41549192", "ja": "すみません。本当はもうひとり参加する予定の\nアイドルがいるのですが、休暇期間中でして……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1002_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "2c6ceb54436a70a8381a4d2f822521044d47a952a929bc06b88919fbe21fd111", "ja": "構いませんよ！　よろしければ、今日の話を\n持ち帰って、共有して頂ければと思います。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1003_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "739bdf7498bc1b08354a59e5efcb486815b79fb97c6de25cd694f67517157242", "ja": "きっと、参加してくださるかと！\nそれでは、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1008_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "674c7555672c337104c566c57c559be14ef3acb735294c598de10bf00757150b", "ja": "配信番組『#プレイリスト』は全10回。途中、\nドラマなど映像作品とのタイアップも予定しています。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1009_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "a0fb757cb7b9fe1c5f066d2ba81ad4679095467dc006eb79c7e1ce601a88651e", "ja": "施設も楽曲も、弊社がご提供。楽曲のリテイクなどは\n柔軟、かつ即時対応させていただきます。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "17bbfde264b8cd7886cc259f7e8c3af1aa054b7d1f6fa16b47bcca53bbfd78b1", "ja": "あの～。質問なんですけど、\nあそこにいる女の子たちは……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1011_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "90ea5ba9b716b730c39a882957bca867ee4061b6e0df96f8ab1744774b608609", "ja": "はい。実は我が社でもオリジナルのアイドル企画を\n展開しておりまして、そのメンバーになります。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1012_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "21ab5c55a73d1a5f44f7d8c2bc93044dab99dacb39925ad24d8e388169f61371", "ja": "希良乃（きらの）、香喃（かなん）、萌亞（もあ）。\n彼女たちの配信番組と、対決企画なども考えています。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "b9f5a1d1942cda0a3b546d125e56d9875d4af4ede5a6a473b882beff6c6e9e17", "ja": "た、対決ですか？\nそんなの聞いてなかったような……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1014_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "a4f888601f108889d863852a2b97af300e119181bd6f2d578f67fee31cbe11ab", "ja": "アイドル業界とは過酷な競争社会。\n先の読めぬ展開こそ、熱狂を生みます。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "56902b7ecc00bf3b575f2fc20d3c817098cd5127cbfac10cdfd854a1ff044b91", "ja": "……{$P$}。\n今回のお話、少々強引な気がするのですが。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1016_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "bc42db738e788929c63b9af9ef4d4a7810bc81eb540b4af6f39385ad33ede30a", "ja": "おや、不審に思われましたか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "40fa35d7170b096bc8c6a4cbf6a426b05fc78bc0de36538076f3506b9210cdde", "ja": "！\nいえ、そういうわけでは……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0f229f383466e92105830c7e6290d446b935fb6fc67314e48dbf0229bee1d544", "ja": "失礼しました。プロジェクトの熱の入りよう、\n規模やスピード感に圧倒されているだけです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1019_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "ce17cde2d36f14f993fe4a4d519d908ee4a56f74cdb25391b9c7b557c6f2a348", "ja": "より良いコンテンツ作りのためですから。\nご希望があれば、いくらでも承りますよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c6356a771df2a22f93f121e0485cf87e1b42d4ee2cae4a8598909a68a1c0412", "ja": "いくらでも……。あっ！　じゃあ、控え室に\nお菓子をい～っぱい用意してもらうとか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1021_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "74017d7f0d5adc0773ebf8aa9a7399ed5b7849288b8659322e49614c3396a415", "ja": "ご用意しますよ！　最近だと、撮影スタジオでは\nキャラメルのたっぷり入ったチョコバーが人気です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1022_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "7b6d5ad32fe47f92e5b81988b8ee637070ed87471f46d2ae6050466d26ef68bc", "ja": "配信番組がスタートしたら、お好きなものを。\n撮影の度に、それこそ山のようにご用意しますよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "1bac51520ed5cd1f12fe958de36b74ab46f9d6b3a2ba23811e825a7a58fc0b0c", "ja": "ううっ！？\nそれはおいしそうかも……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1024_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "7ae5f804aea44a51b89fa8ba7ca872c2669fc4a85981c62517770d8726041e65", "ja": "他にご希望はありませんか？　首を縦に振って\n頂けるなら、何でもご用意いたしますよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5658191ee1aeb2e98f6e4db9b93bbc2cbe4c625fdbb0a73e1b86ec2ec158e8b5", "ja": "（なるほど、ネトスワのやりたい事は大体わかった。\nさて、どうしたものか）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1026_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "5a94f28c87cc52a0b2e73ea5f4c96d272f179fda819e4a8e595bd6138dd54d4a", "ja": "まだ、何か懸念がありますか？\nでは……。……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e006350112e4ad412dd1418748bd813ad4ef9e593b1d875eb72ba58d82d8feac", "ja": "（？　なんだ？\n今、女の子たちに合図のようなものを……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1028_kirano", "source_sha256": "bde4e646b09dadb37077c40f17d348b6523b69dad278423961e2af8067ae1f81", "ja": "あのさ、さっきから聞いてたけど。\nそんなに私たちに負けたくない？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1030_kirano", "source_sha256": "2546cad83fb42437896460579f884cb4729d561aa71f7ee773de0d065e3fd2e4", "ja": "私たち、配信はプロだから。\n勝負なんかしても、勝つに決まってるしね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1031_moa", "source_sha256": "228c823cfd99409ab689a6d8d8610b7306c3cb9f2dac348b081281ee8be4fe4d", "ja": "そうなったらバレちゃうもんね？\n765プロなんて、大したことないって♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "97009bd412a0d8643b6ad5df81d8c4524e22a38e8a23f1bdab07b46a3fde6900", "ja": "そ、そんなことない！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "8adc355b1ffa8e25a31e183bed3340c159d3efd0ef3011e7681135cd35df8113", "ja": "そ、そうです！　765プロはとってもとっても、\n大したことあります！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "214146cf99e0a0a5ad374cd3662e9043f6b7d54decb0e787cd889e296faee0b6", "ja": "未来、可奈。\n大丈夫だから、落ち着いて。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8d7443010e4dd233ae01c433765fb89a08c425a1088f674ddbae39f3bb2d1a74", "ja": "（今度は煽りときたか……。しかも、\nうちのアイドルに効く言葉をよく知っているな）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1036_kanon", "source_sha256": "d999ce6081b60299ebaf6d2193856e768ce6f2901c92cfd0677592d675350790", "ja": "ネトスワからのオファーを迷うなんて……。\n判断の遅い人間についていくと、不幸になるわよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6ac9ae361279dc2d8f062359df0caab6648d90cce35f568d1bd3be62cace6876", "ja": "！\n……だらなこと言うとんなまいや……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "119a4597d4647ea81b1ce6c0543ba0aa79d781dd4e7932a411e0896b6a3b4ef4", "ja": "！？　つ、紬！！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ae603c8cf1be08daf8742a1ec3bcf1b0e16ae949d45f9ce80a16f932724c6d34", "ja": "オファーをくださったことは光栄ですが、\nあまりに礼を失していませんか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1040_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cffeb6762793cd6870d26ff34d49dfa6d91b48cb79e2871125e9bbed258d7919", "ja": "礼節ある振る舞いをしてくれたなら、\nこちらも礼をもって……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1041_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "3cd2712fc36546d5141417906707dadee6c606bf056c271a25b60c5791ca0fa9", "ja": "なるほど、そうすれば\nオファーを受けてくださると！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d58b4474ea83d76f3fe45aed41bd22d0f26219c408d4be4d680b9ae499da66c5", "ja": "……は？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1043_toukatumaneja", "source_sha256": "fe53a772d5239800f2b1185b2656dee067296d4245cd7694657070580c8bb7e4", "ja": "3人とも、非礼を詫びなさい。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_02_1044_kiranomoakanon", "source_sha256": "d220b4af144a227436ea9cd4ceb98a30cf0eee8647117516bbd5470568a9baef", "ja": "すみませんでした。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
